==Description==
The '''Halloween 2019 Crate''' is an exclusive [[Crates|crate]] that was only purchasable during the [[Halloween 2019 Event]] for a cost of {{Coins|3,333}}. This crate provided special Halloween-themed skins.

==Appearance==
{{Tabber
|Current
|The '''Halloween 2019 Crate''' resembles the look of an orange, green and black wooden box which was sealed shut. It contains gold on the inside. On its top is the standard shipping symbol indicating which side is up while on the front it had a menacing Halloween face. It was opened with a crowbar.
|Version 2
|The second version of the crate was similar to the [[Basic Crate]], with the difference being the orange color of the box, the green tape keeping it shut and a menacing Halloween face on the side of the box.
|Version 1
|The third crate appearance was similar to the original design of the [[Golden Crate|Golden]] and [[Platinum Crate|Platinum]] crates. Instead of being gold/sirocco, the crate was orange, with a green line on top and a skull for the keyhole. 
There were also bat wings on the back of the crate.
}}

