==Trivia==
*In the [[Overhaul v1.3|Frost Invasion Update]], some skins from the [[Pumpkin Crate]] and [[Spooky Crate]] were added to the '''Halloween 2019 Crate''', despite the crate being unobtainable. This was most likely a bug.
*This was the first event [[Crates|crate]] to be added to the game.
*The cost of this crate, {{Coins|3,333}}, is unusual since 3,333 is deemed to be a [[wp:3#As a lucky or unlucky number|spiritual number]] by some.
*Some of the skins obtainable through the '''Halloween 2019 Crate''' could later be gotten through the [[Pumpkin Crate]], the [[Spooky Crate]] and the [[Halloween Crate|2023 Halloween Crate]].

